  ($mig$HealthIT_News$mig$, $mig$Health workers call for Palantir to be booted from NHS contracts$mig$, $mig$https://www.computerweekly.com/news/366640417/Health-workers-call-for-Palantir-to-be-booted-from-NHS-contracts$mig$, $mig$NHS England has signed a £330m seven-year contract with Palantir to deliver the Federated Data Platform (FDP), which could enable UK government departments, such as the Home Office and police departments, to more easily access patient data. Medact warns that this could lead to data-driven state abuses of power if people's sensitive health information is shared with these bodies.$mig$, $mig$TripleP Studio - Stock.Adobe.com News Health workers call for Palantir to be booted from NHS contracts Health justice charity Medact warns that Palantir’s involvement in NHS data systems is a threat to patients and healthcare organisations Share this$mig$, '2026-05-21 19:25+00'::timestamptz),
